From: Tuth <tuth3378@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:58:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 17/24] MS2000 recreate-pingpong: makeRoom self-destroy FIX +
 full instrumentation map

MEASURED (bankstorm, warden 4096 MB, 30 s runs):
- makeRoom: create @ 0xFF0000 destroys block @ 0xFF0000  <- the create's own room-maker
  destroyed the LIVE starts-here block at the same pc, while destroyToRecreate skips it.
  Every cycle re-emitted ~256 bytes into the asmjit pool (entry ptr +0x100 per recreate,
  17.9M recreates/30 s) and the retired code never released while the trampoline stayed
  entered -> 4.3 GB commit, warden kill, bad_alloc, no boot (log tail: funcRecreate
  std::exception bad allocation).
- FIX: makeRoomForFirstInstruction aborts (returns false) when the block in the way
  STARTS at _pc - the live block is valid for this pc, the create is redundant.
- AFTER: makeRoom destroys 0, WS 3494 -> 485 MB (flat), leak DEAD.

Still open - the recreate dispatch source (now a no-op livelock, 1.4-2.4 B/30 s):
- ASM execUntilCycles dispatch: trace-cmp on the loaded target - NEVER funcRecreate.
- execOneEnsureRun / chain-exec / Jit::run / JitTrampoline::execOne: all instrumented,
  all NEVER see &funcRecreate as the func arg.
- Table writers: occupyArea interior-mark NEVER fires at 0xFF0000; entries never hold it.
- [BT] funcRecreate caller = STABLE POOL address (generated code): fits a PARENT BLOCK's
  emitted jmp to a child whose m_func is a funcRecreate placeholder - the trampoline
  call-return lands as the caller address, and no table-reading dispatcher can see it.
- Next: symbolize the pool caller; grep finalize( callers + single-op cache func handling;
  find who finalizes a JitBlockRuntimeData with funcRecreate or leaves it linkable.

Instruments (all capped, stderr): recreate snapshots (chains/mode/entry/ptrs), funcRecreate
slot-vs-self, execUntilCycles ASM funcRecreate-cmp + trace thunk, execOne(funcRecreate)
caller, watchpoints on occupy/unoccupy at 0xFF0000 (INTERIOR vs FIRST), mode-change log,
hot-entry forced-splits (planner boundary after 16 recreates - kept, harmless), makeRoom
destroy log.
